  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ac62aa48-70c4-4f1d-8c32-a1fa00b93433.png\" alt=\"坚如磐石模组标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252fglitchfiend.bsky.social\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_c0ac8421-76cc-495e-a72e-acee3ea9954c.png\" alt=\"在Bluesky关注我们\" width=\"220\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fGlitchfiend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_452403c6-3e00-4724-9374-3bc2cc63c95c.png\" alt=\"在X平台关注我们\" width=\"168\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/GyyzU6T\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_ad556c43-5917-431a-8235-9b35362bb4e9.png\" alt=\"加入Discord社区\" width=\"212\" height=\"38\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Adubbz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_6f92a5cd-9aaa-413d-977a-17f1d8514f5f.png\" alt=\"在Patreon支持我们\" width=\"236\" height=\"38\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dAdubbzG%2540gmail.com%2526cy_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_fa447003-984d-4019-abd1-9672a3bc22a6.png\" alt=\"通过PayPal捐赠\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\"></a></p><h2>模组简介</h2><hr><h4>《坚如磐石》是一款生存模组，通过添加体温与口渴等机制来提升游戏挑战性。</h4><h3>注意：1.16版本暂未实装体温系统！</h3><h2>使用条款与说明</h2><hr><h3>Minecraft 1.20.4及以上版本*需搭配 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_495a5f28-8271-4409-8b44-eb0f4ff99ea7.png\" alt=\"GlitchCore图标\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a> 运行！Fabric版本还需安装 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>。</h3><p><em>*模组版本9.2.0.171及以上时，1.20.1版本同样需要GlitchCore</em></p><p><em>您可以将本模组纳入CurseForge托管的整合包，前提是：不重新托管模组文件、仅使用我们直接上传的构建版本、不出售整合包或通过任何形式提供模组付费访问权限，且遵守所用模组版本许可证中的所有条款。</em></p><h2>Glitchfiend其他作品</h2><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_536c8bbe-66d9-4d24-86f7-e65b8e346053.png\" alt=\"超多生物群系标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serene-seasons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/246391/description_afd5e266-e85c-4127-99cf-84092e4adbd5.png\" alt=\"静谧四季标志\" width=\"336\" height=\"160\"></a></p>",
